<div class="section-no">05 — Results</div>
<h2>Accepted Length and Decoding Speedup</h2>
<p>All results are evaluated on DeepSeek-V4-Flash under identical decoding and evaluation configurations using vLLM. The benchmark suite covers math (GSM8K, MATH-500, AIME25), code (HumanEval, MBPP, LiveCodeBench), and chat (MT-Bench) — 7 tasks in total.</p>

<h3>Average Accepted Length τ (Non-thinking mode, T=0)</h3>
