<p>The speedup comparison makes the acceptance-rate cliff concrete: MTP(6) is <em>slower</em> than MTP(3) despite drafting twice as many tokens. Adding more draft steps when the acceptance rate has already collapsed only adds verification overhead. HyperDFlash's 2.80× speedup is 24% above MTP(3) and 62% above vanilla DFlash — all using the same 6-step draft budget.</p>

